---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | KloudXP"
  description="KloudXP Privacy Policy in compliance with GDPR and international data protection standards."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <div class="space-y-8 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">Data Governance & Privacy</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: January 2026</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-300">
        <p>
          At <strong>Kloud Xperts</strong> (hereinafter "KloudXP"), headquartered at Av. de las Américas 320, Altamira, 45160 Zapopan, Jalisco, Mexico, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and Mexican federal privacy statutes (LFPDPPP).
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Customer Data Custody Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          KloudXP operates strictly as an infrastructure provider. We never access, scan, index, or transfer the contents of customer virtual machine disks, databases, or object storage repositories without explicit written authorization or mandatory court order.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
